cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "foods-penalty-measurability: instrument audit, products and pre-registration register for a measurement audit of Chinese food-safety penalty records"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen products, provenance sheet and append-only pre-registration register for a
  measurement audit of 1,128 food-safety documents (875 Chinese administrative penalty
  decisions, 253 US recall records). The repository supports one question — what can this
  record measure? — and reports agreement, within-frame composition, commodity precision,
  and the three axes (prevalence, trend, case-chain structure) that the record cannot
  support, each with the measurement that shows why.
